---
description: React-specific engineering rules
globs: "**/*.{jsx,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use function components and hooks.
Do not use useEffect for derived values.
Keep effects for synchronization with external systems and clean them up correctly.
Prefer clear component composition, local state ownership, semantic HTML, accessible interactions, and deliberate loading/error/empty states.
Avoid memoization unless it solves a demonstrated or structurally clear problem.
